// "Discard [cards]" [CR#701.9a]: move them from their owner's hand to that
// player's graveyard. Lean `Actor.discard`: the hand is the actor's, and the
// deed records the actor as its performer. An indefinite subject ("a card")
// implies its own selection, made by default by the affected player
// [CR#701.9b]; a random selection is marked on the indefinite.
KeywordAction(
    name: "discard",
    params: [Subject],
    spelling: "discard",
    grammar: Verb(
        bare: "discard",
        frame_set: Transitive,
    ),
    body: move(Param(0), handOf(actor), graveyard),
)
